# Input

```md
| a | b |
|-|-|

| Specify the selected option : | Option 1 |
|:--| --- |

|    Should print as compact table when --proseWrap=never|a long long long long long long long long long long long long long head|
|---|--:|

> quoted|table
> ---|---
> one|two

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "lineWidth": 40,
      "proseWrap": "never"
    },
    "parser": {
      "gfm": true
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```md
| a   | b   |
| --- | --- |

| Specify the selected option : | Option 1 |
| :-- | --- |

| Should print as compact table when --proseWrap=never | a long long long long long long long long long long long long long head |
| --- | --: |

> | quoted | table |
> | ------ | ----- |
> | one    | two   |

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
    7: | Should print as compact table when --proseWrap=never | a long long long long long long long long long long long long long head |
```
